queles imóveis raros — onde tudo convida você a desacelerar e aproveitar o melhor da vida. Um lugar onde você simplesmente não vê a hora de chegar.\n\nO edifício, imponente, oferece portaria presencial 24 horas e a praticidade de 2 vagas livres, com capacidade para até 3 carros grandes ou 4 veículos menores.\n\nPara quem valoriza espaço, luz, privacidade e o estilo de vida que só Curitiba sabe oferecer.","fotos":["https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/69cb80d757c49b1d59f90e5a/pilar-homes-images-watermark/c14e8143-8783-4d22-b10c-efc7af021f2c.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/69cb80d757c49b1d59f90e5a/pilar-homes-images-watermark/3ab9c767-1467-4572-8ab9-01f891a13b7a.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/69cb80d757c49b1d59f90e5a/pilar-homes-images-watermark/fe820c96-d391-4abf-95c8-bbd710517bdf.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/69cb80d757c49b1d59f90e5a/pilar-homes-images-watermark/33b54b00-73b0-455d-baef-b6a833dd780b.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/69cb80d757c49b1d59f90e5a/pilar-homes-images-watermark/85727500-eed4-4f18-b402-6fe1c99c1b8f.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/69cb80d757c49b1d59f90e5a/pilar-homes-images-watermark/47346742-4dcd-4ba6-a062-74a0aab385cc.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/69cb80d757c49b1d59f90e5a/pilar-homes-images-watermark/dbd2e937-7913-4874-a854-25e59f4625c4.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/69cb80d757c49b1d59f90e5a/pilar-homes-images-watermark/b3f4b973-6b55-4a33-804d-2ea6c8a7d6de.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/69cb80d757c49b1d59f90e5a/pilar-homes-images-watermark/c95f92f3-3dee-48c9-ac6d-a4bca196c867.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/69cb80d757c49b1d59f90e5a/pilar-homes-images-watermark/2a70adb1-ccba-4e2b-9654-af5f9ff2a73e.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/69cb80d757c49b1d59f90e5a/pilar-homes-imag